{"content_hash": "c09cb8191fed76b5", "version_id": 771, "article_id": 78, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Jokić scores 35 as Nuggets win after 23-point comeback", "title_zh": "约基奇砍35分，掘金落后23分完成大逆转", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/25/jokic-says-booing-fans-not-welcome-after-nuggets-rally-from-23-points-down-to-beat-pelicans", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722653-c611b7f78c32?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGpva2klMjBib29pbmclMjBmYW5zfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTI5NzA4NDV8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-in-blue-and-white-uniform-on-stadium-_zukO8E8-bY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(325, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(3, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "219d721cfe25"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-26", "word_count": 93, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "The Denver Nuggets were losing by 23 points. Then they came back and won. Nikola Jokić was not happy with some fans.", "lead_zh": "丹佛掘金一度落后23分，但随后完成逆转取胜。尼古拉·约基奇对一些球迷感到不满。", "preview": "The Denver Nuggets played the New Orleans Pelicans on Saturday. At half-time, the Nuggets were down 73-57. Some home fans booed the team.", "preview_zh": "周六，丹佛掘金对阵新奥尔良鹈鹕。半场结束时，掘金以57比73落后。一些主场球迷对球队发出了嘘声。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 761, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/78/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 36.075, "size_bytes": 217440, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 114, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6f