到42分。掘金在加时赛中以141比135获胜。", "赛后，约基奇谈到了发出嘘声的球迷。他说这些球迷不必再来了。他说他的球队从不放弃。", "特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分。鹈鹕目前已连输三场。"], "body": "The Denver Nuggets played the New Orleans Pelicans on Saturday. At half-time, the Nuggets were down 73-57. Some home fans booed the team.\n\nIn the second half, the Nuggets came back. Jokić scored 35 points and had 15 rebounds and 10 assists. Jamal Murray scored 42 points. Denver won 141-135 in overtime.\n\nAfter the game, Jokić spoke about the booing fans. He said those fans do not need to come anymore. He said his team never quits.\n\nTrey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points. The Pelicans have now lost three games.", "body_zh": "周六，丹佛掘金对阵新奥尔良鹈鹕。半场结束时，掘金以57比73落后。一些主场球迷对球队发出了嘘声。\n\n下半场，掘金奋起直追。约基奇得到35分、15个篮板和10次助攻。贾马尔·穆雷得到42分。掘金在加时赛中以141比135获胜。\n\n赛后，约基奇谈到了发出嘘声的球迷。他说这些球迷不必再来了。他说他的球队从不放弃。\n\n特雷·墨菲三世为鹈鹕拿下26分。鹈鹕目前已连输三场。", "text": "The Denver Nuggets played the New Orleans Pelicans on Saturday. At half-time, the Nuggets were down 73-57. Some home fans booed the team. In the second half, the Nuggets came back. Jokić scored 35 points and had 15 rebounds and 10 assists. Jamal Murray scored 42 points. Denver won 141-135 in overtime. After the game, Jokić spoke about the booing fans. He said those fans do not need to come anymore. He said his team never quits. Trey Murphy III led New Orleans with 26 points. The Pelicans have now lost three games.", "vocab": [{"word": "boo", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发出嘘声", "note": "观众表达不满时用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球迷；粉丝", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "half-time", "pos": "noun", "zh": "半场休息", "note": "比赛中间休息的时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "come back", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "逆转；追回来", "note": "比分落后时追分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "score", "pos": "verb", "zh": "得分", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "point", "pos": "noun", "zh": "分", "note": "比赛中的得分单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "overtime", "pos": "noun", "zh": "加时赛", "note": "平局后增加